      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is a step-by-step approach to managing the crisis and crafting the communication buffer:\n\n1. **Immediate Internal Communication:**\n   - Alert all concerned departments: logistics, client services, and finance. Designate team leaders to liaise with the HQ and the VIP account holders. Stress the importance of a unified message.\n\n2. **Crafting the Communication Buffer:**\n   - Draft an email template and another via phone call. The email should be highly professional, using language that suggests a temporary technical issue requiring immediate attention. Be transparent but vague about the specifics to prevent panic.\n\n### Email Template:\n**Subject: Urgent System Maintenance Notification - Our Operations Commitment to Excellence**\n\nDear [Client's Name],\n\nWe appreciate you reaching out regarding your anticipated shipment, Horizon Tech HS (Manifest #HT-99281). We aim to promptly clear any ambiguities and communicate the latest developments on your shipment status.\n\nDue to a crucial system maintenance initiated by our highly secure and state-of-the-art logistics systems, we regret to inform you that the latest tracking information and document access are temporarily unavailable. This maintenance is part of Horizon Tech's comprehensive strategy to ensure continuous, high-quality service and secure operations.\n\nWe are facing a highly rare and unexpected system anomaly requiring immediate expert",
